  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilience Building for Flood Affected areas of Chimanimani</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To build back the resilience of communities affected by flooding and drought in Chimanimani District, Zimbabwe, through increasing agriculture production, through increasing access to finance and through increasing community alertness to natural disasters through linking existing community structures to national structures responsible for early warning systems (EWS).</narrative>
  </description>
